<article class="env-lemma" id="0AP1">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0AP1">Lemma <span data-tag="0AP1">15.44.5</span>.</a> Let $A$ be a Noetherian local ring. Then $A$ is a discrete valuation ring if and only if $A^\wedge $ is so. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows from Lemmas <a href="/tag/07NV" data-tag="07NV">15.44.1</a> and <a href="/tag/07NY" data-tag="07NY">15.44.4</a> and Algebra, Lemma <a href="/tag/00PD" data-tag="00PD">10.119.7</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>